iption%22%3A%22All%20bow%20or%20crossbow%20attacks%20combine%20the%20arcane%20type%20with%20the%20type%20of%20the%20weapon%20used%2C%20so%20that%20resistance%20to%20arcane%20does%20not%20penalize%20the%20user.%22%2C%22special_note%22%3A%22This%20unit%E2%80%99s%20bow%20or%20crossbow%20attacks%20are%20treated%20as%20arcane%20instead%20of%20the%20declared%20damage%20type%20if%20that%20would%20increase%20the%20damage.%22%2C%22alternative_type%22%3A%22arcane%22%2C%22affect_self%22%3A%22yes%22%2C%22overlay_image%22%3A%22misc%2Fcrystal-quiver-icon.png%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_student%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_weapon%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22range%22%3A%22ranged%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22bow%2Ccrossbow%2Ccomposite%20bow%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22else%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22allow_undo%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22else%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
